msgid "Yuva cloud"
msgstr "Yuva cloud"

#: src/copy/docs.ts
msgid "Yuva documentation"
msgstr "Documentation Yuva"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Yuva Email Worker for Cloudflare"
msgstr "Yuva Email Worker pour Cloudflare"

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Yuva finds the e-mail channel for the recipient address and threads the message by In-Reply-To and References into the conversation it belongs to. Anything else starts a new conversation. A reply reopens the conversation."
msgstr "Yuva trouve le canal courriel de l'adresse du destinataire et rattache le message, grâce à In-Reply-To et References, à la conversation à laquelle il appartient. Tout le reste ouvre une nouvelle conversation. Une réponse rouvre la conversation."

#: src/copy/shadcn.ts
